  "solution": {
    "text": "Acceleration due to gravity is given by,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>GM</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br />where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math> is gravitational constant.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">For</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">earth</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>GM</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">For</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">planet</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>GM</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Given</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></math><br /><br />Putting the values in the Eq. (i), we obtain<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
